// StreamLiveSend Server-sent events of a send: a snapshot event at once and on every change, a heartbeat event every 15 s
//
// Each `snapshot` event carries the whole live state; its id is the snapshot version, so a reconnecting EventSource resumes with Last-Event-ID. A `heartbeat` event every 15 s says the connection is alive while nothing changes: a monitor that hears nothing for longer treats its data as stale.
