// Answers 202 with the message ID and status queued (scheduled with send_at). Errors are RFC 9457 problems whose detail says what to fix: template_not_found, template_not_published, missing_variables (listed in missing), invalid_recipient, recipient_suppressed (with the reason and date), sender_not_verified, attachments_too_large (naming the route's provider limit), rate_limited (with Retry-After), no_healthy_route. Send an Idempotency-Key header: a retry with the same key within 24 hours gets the first answer and sends nothing. A test-mode key delivers only to the workspace's members and its allowed test addresses.
